  - placeId: haven.fisher_s_rest.1
    name: The fishers' lantern
    verb: Light
    item: {fileID: 0}
    amount: 1
    taken: The flame takes. Out on the water, toward the Island Stones, nothing answers, and that is how it should be.
    offset: {x: -5.5, y: -1.5}
