  - placeId: haven.standing_stones.0
    name: The pact's words
    verb: Set the ember, and read
    item: {fileID: 0}
    amount: 1
    taken: 'The ember takes in the cold ring. Something like breath goes through the stones, and frost fills the cuts: keep the fire, and the wood keeps faith. Let it go cold, and it takes back what it gave.'
    offset: {x: 5, y: -3}
    marker: {fileID: 1987186056636952893, guid: 9c63895aedf974b41ac19d55902cc357, type: 3}
    markerScale: 0.7
