  - placeId: haven.wayfarer_s_stones.3
    name: The names in the stones
    verb: Read
    item: {fileID: 0}
    amount: 1
    taken: 'Names, a whole village of them, cut deep, and the same words under each: we go north to find the door. The last name is cut shallow, as if in a hurry.'
    offset: {x: 3, y: 2}
    marker: {fileID: 1987186056636952893, guid: 9c63895aedf974b41ac19d55902cc357, type: 3}
    markerScale: 0.6
    markerTurn: 20
    questTarget: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 55033df2638165d41819ee2b225a9c14, type: 2}
